# Word Source Of Truth

- Never edit or "fix" files under `data/raw/` (Word source files).
- Treat Word files as the canonical source of truth for atlas content.
- If typos, wrong units, or other source-content errors are found, report them clearly to the user instead of changing extracted JSON to hide the issue.
- Re-run extraction/validation after source updates, but do not alter source wording in code or processed files to bypass source errors.
